Vault Deployment and Hiera Integration
Purpose
Deploy HashiCorp Vault for secure secret storage and integrate it with Puppet Hiera.

Architecture
Puppet Server (puppet2)
        |
        | Hiera Vault Lookup
        |
        v
Vault Server (vault)
Vault Installation
Download Vault
cd /tmp

wget https://releases.hashicorp.com/vault/1.18.3/vault_1.18.3_linux_amd64.zip

unzip vault_1.18.3_linux_amd64.zip

sudo mv vault /usr/local/bin/

vault --version
Create Service User
sudo useradd --system \
  --home /opt/vault \
  --shell /sbin/nologin \
  vault
Create Directories
sudo mkdir -p \
  /opt/vault/data \
  /opt/vault/tls \
  /etc/vault.d

sudo chown -R vault:vault /opt/vault
TLS Configuration
Place certificates:

vault.crt
vault.key
ca.crt
in:

/opt/vault/tls/
Set permissions:

sudo chown vault:vault /opt/vault/tls/*
sudo chmod 600 /opt/vault/tls/vault.key
Vault Configuration
File:

/etc/vault.d/vault.hcl
storage "raft" {
  path = "/opt/vault/data"
  node_id = "vault"
}

listener "tcp" {
  address       = "0.0.0.0:8200"
  tls_cert_file = "/opt/vault/tls/vault.crt"
  tls_key_file  = "/opt/vault/tls/vault.key"
}

api_addr     = "https://vault.train.local.a1.by:8200"
cluster_addr = "https://vault.train.local.a1.by:8201"

ui = true
Systemd Service
File:

/etc/systemd/system/vault.service
[Unit]
Description=HashiCorp Vault
After=network.target

[Service]
User=vault
Group=vault

ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/vault server \
  -config=/etc/vault.d/vault.hcl

Restart=always

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
Enable service:

sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable --now vault
Vault Initialization
export VAULT_ADDR=https://vault.train.local.a1.by:8200

vault operator init > vault-init.json
Store securely:

/root/vault-init.json
Unseal Vault
Use 3 of 5 generated keys:

vault operator unseal
Repeat until:

Sealed: false
Root Token
export VAULT_TOKEN=<ROOT_TOKEN>
Verify:

vault token lookup
Puppet Policy
File:

/root/puppet-hiera-policy.hcl
path "secret/data/puppet/*" {
  capabilities = ["read", "list"]
}
Create policy:

vault policy write puppet-hiera \
  /root/puppet-hiera-policy.hcl
Create Puppet Token
vault token create \
  -policy=puppet-hiera \
  -period=720h
Save token:

/root/puppet-hiera.token
Puppet Integration
Store token:

/etc/puppetlabs/puppetserver/vault/token
Set permissions*

chown puppet:puppet \
  *etc/puppetlabs/puppetserver/vault/*oken

chmod 600 \
  /etc/puppetlab*/puppetserver/vault/token
